abstract: >-
  Post-hoc scorecard for a saved agent run. Ingest a dump or
  multi-agent trace, score a metric catalog, and roll the
  result into an eight-question card. Not a certification or
  live safety control.
keywords:
  - evaluation
  - agents
  - LLM-as-judge
  - scorecard
